{"unit_id":"winston-hoo__dsh-spec-forge#feature-1","repo":"winston-hoo/dsh-spec-forge","commit":"84a09ce4e2ceed9a94b29f9f5d27e9d4ba9f0f54","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-spec-forge 的功能「历史模板召回」：根据用户传入的原始需求检索模板，并返回命中内容、项目禁区和下一步路由。通过 spec_recall 工具触发，输入需求文本，可选提供工作目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:244-248","lib/match.js:642-646"]}
{"unit_id":"winston-hoo__dsh-spec-forge#feature-2","repo":"winston-hoo/dsh-spec-forge","commit":"84a09ce4e2ceed9a94b29f9f5d27e9d4ba9f0f54","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-spec-forge 的功能「需求体检」：从实现目标、改动方式、约束和上下文四个维度整理需求，并生成分级报告。仅在路由要求体检时调用 spec_triage，输入需求文本，输出报告和必要问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:426-430","lib/render.js:337-372"]}
{"unit_id":"winston-hoo__dsh-spec-forge#feature-3","repo":"winston-hoo/dsh-spec-forge","commit":"84a09ce4e2ceed9a94b29f9f5d27e9d4ba9f0f54","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-spec-forge 的功能「提示词提炼」：把需求细节、限制和验收条件组装成可执行提示词。用户通过 spec_distill 提供需求及相关清单，工具返回提示词，并可指出缺失的约束。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:483-490"]}
{"unit_id":"winston-hoo__dsh-spec-forge#feature-4","repo":"winston-hoo/dsh-spec-forge","commit":"84a09ce4e2ceed9a94b29f9f5d27e9d4ba9f0f54","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-spec-forge 的功能「模板沉淀」：把完成任务的做法保存为可复用模板，可包含触发场景、澄清清单、步骤、禁区、提示词及验收标准。通过 spec_retro 提交，模板按项目或全局范围存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:581-590","lib/store.js:323-340"]}
